---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <h1>Website Mission Statement</h1>
  <p>StuporBowl.org exists as an attempt to preserve the Stupor Bowl race in a digital format for current and future generations of racers.</p>

  <h2>Objectives</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Attempt to isolate Stupor Bowl entirely from evil corporate entities such as Meta, Alphabet and any other conglomorate who would only sell our racers'
      data for profit.
      <ul>
        <li>Put more plainly: Never use Facebook, Instagram or Google again for any reason whatsoever for this race. Full stop.</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Host as accurate as practical historical data about the race and its results.</li>
    <li>Invite content contributions from the community.</li>
    <li>Be the source for each year's racer registration.</li>
    <li>Build tools for each year's organizers to allow them to easily understand race information and make announcements to the racers.</li>
    <li>Be a source of truth for current year race information.</li>
    <li>Maintain a Code of Conduct with the community.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Non-Objectives</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Be the final authority on the Stupor Bowl race and its history.</li>
    <li>Host 100% accurate historical information about the race and its results.</li>
    <li>Maintian an immutable archive.</li>
    <li>Gatekeep access to this website's archive and codebase.</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
